WEBVTT

00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:03.938
Protect routes with caller authentication.

00:00:03.938 --> 00:00:10.841
Three kinds of auth provider.

00:00:10.841 --> 00:00:17.696
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:23.303
Auth providers are defined once in the Shared Collection.

00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:32.600
Test the login right here, using the provider's own settings.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:38.381
A gateway opts in with Requires auth.

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:44.491
Callers then send the session as a Bearer token. Active sessions are listed on the left.

00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:47.858
Without a token, the route answers 401.

00:00:47.858 --> 00:00:53.234
Log in, then send the token.
